ctions, **Play W8** is optimal because:\n- W8 cannot complete any chow without W6/W7 or W9/W10 (invalid), both of which are partially exposed.\n- Across player completed W5-W6-W7, meaning they likely hold W8 for continuity \u2014 thus risky to keep.\n- No internal sequence possibility with my current W7 and W8 unless W6 appears, but W6 is already used.\n- Eliminating W8 cleans the hand toward simpler structure, possibly aiming for All Simples or Mixed Shifted Chows using T2-T3-T4 or W2-W3-W4 if draws improve.\n\nAnswer: Play W8"}
